- Initial package of NEdit Classic 5.7+git20260411.dd40844
  (alx210/nedit-classic fork, with Xft and MWM/EMWM workspace support)
  * Build with Xft (anti-aliased fonts), %optflags and the
    distribution linker flags
  * Rename the client program nc to ncl to avoid the conflict with
    netcat, as recommended by upstream
  * Generate the nedit(1) and ncl(1) man pages from the POD sources
  * Add a desktop file (nedit.desktop)
